OL,3,GNEWSAHow a lorry driver's cup of tea
OL,4,Aled to an #80m cocaine bust
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter an HGV driver reported that his
OL,7,Fcontainer had been broken into, rapid
OL,8,Faction by police officers led to the
OL,9,Fdiscovery of more than #80m in cocaine.
OL,11,FThree drug smugglers had spent a month
OL,12,Fplanning their operation, hiring
OL,13,Fvehicles and getting people in place
OL,14,Ffor the attempted heist.
OL,16,FTheir plans were foiled when the lorry
OL,17,Fdriver noticed the break-in as he
OL,18,Fstopped for a cuppa at a burger van on
OL,19,Fthe edge of Northampton in November
OL,20,F2021.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
