OL,3,GNEWSAHow a lorry driver's cup of tea
OL,4,Aled to an #80m cocaine bust
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpecialist Metropolitan Police officers
OL,7,Fspent two years investigating the
OL,8,Foperation, and the final member of the
OL,9,Ftrio to be sentenced was jailed this
OL,10,Fweek.
